<title>USA: Organic Solutions appoints new CEO.</title>
<headline>Organic Solutions appoints new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Organic Solutions Inc said Friday that John Brannen resigned as chief executive, chairman of the board and as a director.</p>
<p>He was replaced by Joe Trainor, who has been president of Organic Solutions since last year.  The company said Brannen stepped down to pursue other business interests.</p>
